                         -=] INTRODUCTION [=-                           

GUTINDEX.ALL is a plain text listing of all the eBooks which have been
posted to the Project Gutenberg collection. It is also used to identify
works already in the collection so that there is no duplication, and to
determine what can be added to the collection.

It is not a database, but it is useful for identifying eBooks so that
they can be downloaded or read online.


